  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.9.0 - Kuwantima: Avalonia dependency bump only. Kuwantima.DataGrid: cell-editing chrome and frozen columns.\n\nKuwantima bumps its Avalonia / Avalonia.Themes.Fluent / Avalonia.Desktop dependency from 12.1.3 to 12.1.4. Dependency-minor, not a control change - no controls added, removed, or renamed. Control count stays 16.\n\nThe real news this release is in Kuwantima.DataGrid: inline cell-editing now picks up Kuwantima's own accent styling (DataGridTextColumn's edit-mode TextBox previously rendered as unstyled stock Fluent chrome inside a themed grid - reachable by just double-clicking or F2'ing any editable cell), and frozen columns are now demoed and verified. Both close items that v1.8.0's release notes explicitly listed as out of scope. Row grouping and row-details expansion remain out of scope - see the Kuwantima.DataGrid package's own release notes for the full picture.\n\nBoth packages are versioned in lockstep (same number, same tag) even though only Kuwantima.DataGrid has user-facing changes this release - see CLAUDE.md's Version Management section for why.",
